    "body": "> I don't have a good idea to make this deterministic. My current proposal doesn't affect it, and it's out of scope of this issue.\r\n\r\nWhile I don't think we necessarily need to make it deterministic, it's wholly within the scope of this issue to discuss how it affects them. While we worked on iPadOS, we found dozens of productivity  websites that rely on focusing behavior across iframes. In particular, when `about:blank` iframe is inserted, `autofocus` behavior should be fully deterministic with wherever async model we spec.",
